    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The ring's location, which we\r\ntoo could not find...\r\nThe Crumbling Entrance Path, was it?\r\n'Tis a rare chance — I'm curious what\r\nmanner of place it is.\r\nI'll follow you, so pray, lead the way.",
        "Jp" : "我々も見付けられなかった指輪の場所\r\n《崩れた進入路》、だったかな\r\nせっかくだ、どんなところなのか興味がある\r\n君の後を追うから、先導してくれるかい"
