    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 31031,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To think it lay in a place like this—\r\nNo wonder it could not be found.\r\nWhen we investigated this area...\r\nThat wall had not yet collapsed—",
        "Jp" : "こんなところにあったのか――\r\n見つけられないのも無理はない\r\n我々がこの辺りを調べた時\r\nあの壁は崩れていなかったからな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 793118,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If Queen Cress and I had found it,\r\nQueen Cress would—\r\n...Nay, 'tis no use pondering it now.",
        "Jp" : "もしもクレス様と私が見つけていたなら\r\nクレス様は――\r\nいや、今更考えても仕方がないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 793119,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I believe Queen Cress sought the ring not merely\r\nfor this land's prosperity, but with the next\r\nArisen in mind... and the one who would\r\nbecome the next Dragon.\r\nIn other words — the imperial heirs.",
        "Jp" : "クレス様は、この国の繁栄のためだけでなく\r\n次代の覚者、そして次代の竜となる者\r\nつまり――御子たちのことも思って\r\n指輪を探されていたのだと思う"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 793120,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The heir of House Acre must bear both a ruler's\r\nheavy burden and an Arisen's destiny,\r\nand at so young an age.",
        "Jp" : "アッカー家の王位継承者は\r\n王としての重責と、覚者としての定め\r\nその二つを若くして背負うことになるからね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 793121,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hm—? For all our reminiscing, a\r\nboorish guest appears.\r\n'Tis no matter. Shall I administer\r\na light chastisement?",
        "Jp" : "ん――？　思い出話の最中だというのに\r\n野暮な客のお出ましのようだ\r\n仕方ない、軽くお仕置きしてやろうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 793122,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hehe, truth is...\r\nFighting beside you, an Arisen...\r\nIt calls to mind the days I\r\nspent with Queen Cress.\r\n'Tis strange, but it gladdens me.",
        "Jp" : "ふふふ、実はさ\r\n覚者である君と一緒に戦っていると\r\nクレス様と共にあった頃を思い出す\r\n何だかそれが嬉しくてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797329,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well then, let us go.",
        "Jp" : "さ、いこうじゃないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797330,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30970,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, you've come.\r\nI'd like to go whither the ring was found.\r\nTake me there.\r\n...Pray, forgive my selfishness.",
        "Jp" : "やあ、来たね\r\n指輪のあった場所へ行ってみたいんだ\r\n連れて行ってくれ\r\n――我儘言ってすまないね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790286,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30971,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That skill — truly befitting an Arisen.\r\n—Speaking of Arisen, Prince Nedo\r\nis one as well, yet...\r\nI wonder how his battle prowess fares.",
        "Jp" : "その腕前、流石は覚者だ\r\n――覚者といえば、ネド王子も覚者だが\r\n戦いの腕前はどうなんだろうな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790287,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Unlike Princess Sera, who was educated\r\nas the next Arisen...\r\nI've never seen Prince Nedo wield a blade.\r\nHe seemed devoted to his studies, but—",
        "Jp" : "次代の覚者して教育を受けていらした\r\nセラノ姫と違って、ネド王子が\r\n剣を振るっているのを見たことが無いんだ\r\n勉学には励まれていたようだが――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790288,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, 'tis no place for a long chat...\r\nThere's naught left to behold.\r\nShall we head back early? —You must be weary too?",
        "Jp" : "さて、こんなところで長話するのもなんだし\r\nもう観光するものも無い\r\n早めに帰ろうか――君も疲れたろう？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797331,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30972,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, 'tis no place for a long talk. No more\r\nsights to see. Let's be off, then —\r\nyou must be weary, too.",
        "Jp" : "さて、こんなところで長話するのもなんだし\r\nもう観光するものも無い\r\n早めに帰ろうか――君も疲れたろう？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790289,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30973,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—Hm? Still wish to hear more reminiscences?",
        "Jp" : "――ん？\r\nまだ思い出話が聞きたいのかい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790290,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well now— Having lost the liege I\r\nwas bound to serve,\r\nand with no one left to raise as the\r\nnext High Scepter...\r\nMy life had lost all meaning.",
        "Jp" : "そうだなぁ――\r\n仕えるべき王を失い\r\n次代のハイセプターとして教育する者もいない\r\n私の生に意味は無くなった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790291,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You know, don't you? I ne'er returned to my\r\nfamily hearth... simply whiled away the days in\r\nthis hovel, waiting for time to pass.",
        "Jp" : "実家にも戻らず、このあばら屋で\r\nただ時が過ぎるのを待つ日々だったのは\r\n知っているね？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790292,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But... when I learned you'd found Samara's Ring\r\nof the First King...\r\nI felt 'twas no coincidence.",
        "Jp" : "――だが、君たちがサマラ初代王の指輪を\r\n見つけたと知って――\r\nこれは偶然ではないと感じたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797332,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Acre Selund was driven to the brink of ruin by\r\nthe ebon dragon... yet now, it\r\nstrives to rise anew.",
        "Jp" : "アッカーシェランは、黒き竜によって\r\n滅亡の危機に瀕したが\r\n再び立ち上がろうとしている、と"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797333,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis the nation's will... and I felt strongly\r\nthat Queen Cress's own heart must\r\nsurely lie within it.",
        "Jp" : "それこそが国の意志であり、そこにはきっと\r\nクレス様のお気持ちも含まれるのだろうと\r\nそう強く感じた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797334,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I wish to watch over this land's path ahead—\r\nSuch a wish has taken root in me.",
        "Jp" : "私はこの国のゆく先を見守りたい――\r\nそう願うようになった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797335,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I would ask your cooperation as well.\r\nPrince Nedo seems fond of you—\r\nWould you watch over him henceforth?",
        "Jp" : "君にも、どうか協力してほしいんだ\r\nネド王子は君を慕っているようだし――\r\nこれからも気にかけてやってくれないか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797336,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "...I've already spoken with Cyril and Bacias.\r\nThe Ring of the First King — 'tis best\r\nyou officially keep it.\r\nYou'll wield its power for Acre Selund's\r\ngood, I've no doubt.",
        "Jp" : "――セロとバシアスには私から話を付けておいた\r\nサマラ初代王の指輪は正式に君が持つといい\r\n君なら、必ずその力をアッカーシェランにとっても\r\nいい方向に使ってくれるだろうからね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797337,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30974,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
